  "ingredients": [
    "2 large cucumbers, sliced thin",
    "0.5 medium onion, sliced thin",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup sour cream",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons white vinegar",
    "1 teaspoon dried dill",
    "1 teaspoon dried parsley",
    "0.25 teaspoon paprika, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oPwKmv54zanSacAfSaKTrXve9pc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221075-gurkensalat-german-cucumber-salad-VAT-005-step-01-94b06f86ea924036b28bc93530178d3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221075/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cucumber and onion slices onto a large platter; season with salt on both sides. Let rest for 30 minutes, then drain in a colander and squeeze to remove excess moisture. Blot dry with paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uKVbYpDw_u7oUDKyNogZhy79GgY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221075-gurkensalat-german-cucumber-salad-VAT-006-step-02-052f1a0b1f8940f8957695df9b2348ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221075/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the dressing: Stir sour cream, sugar, vinegar, dill, and parsley together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VuzHdFclgng1WhHTY9nwRsJGo0c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221075-gurkensalat-german-cucumber-salad-VAT-007-step-03-c03b011d840348ce965bec71b2529fc6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221075/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently fold cucumber and onion slices into dressing until coated. Cover and refrigerate, at least 3 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DHTxRnbsrfOTLuNrZmIC3ixHhfA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/221075-gurkensalat-german-cucumber-salad-VAT-008-step-04-01folding-6f5e84bdbce449e8b187e0f9ad2f28c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/221075/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with paprika to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
